OL,3,AMozambique opposition leader faces
OL,4,Atrial over deadly 2024 election unrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FTensions are running high in
OL,7,FMozambique's capital, Maputo, with a
OL,8,Fheavy police deployment as a prominent
OL,9,Fopposition leader goes on trial over
OL,10,Fdeadly protests that followed the
OL,11,Fcountry's disputed 2024 elections.
OL,13,FVenancio Mondlane faces several
OL,14,Fcharges, including incitement to
OL,15,Fterrorism and civil disobedience, over
OL,16,Fprotests that left hundreds of people
OL,17,Fdead. He denies any wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
