OL,3,AMozambique opposition leader faces
OL,4,Atrial over deadly 2024 election unrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity has been tightened around the
OL,7,FSupreme Court, where Mondlane is due to
OL,8,Fappear on Tuesday, with authorities
OL,9,Ffearing a fresh wave of demonstrations
OL,10,Fby his supporters.
OL,12,FPolice have appealed to citizens to
OL,13,Ffollow the proceedings calmly and avoid
OL,14,Factions that could threaten public
OL,15,Forder.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
